# Do NOT add a "!" (force) to this rule. Without force, Netlify serves an
# existing static file before applying the rule, which is what lets the
# prerendered pages from scripts/postbuild.mjs be served with their own
# <title>, Open Graph tags and JSON-LD. Forcing it would send every URL to the
# generic shell and silently undo all of the SEO work.
/*    /index.html   200
